<title>MEXICO: Santander Mexicano names new Afores director.</title>
<headline>Santander Mexicano names new Afores director.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Humberto Allendes was named the new director of private pension fund management firm Afore Santander Mexicano, an affiliate of Banco Santander SA, company officials said.</p>
<p>Allendes replaces Manuel Reynaud, who left recently.</p>
<p>Allendes had been commercial director with a pension fund in Argentina.</p>
<p>Mexico will allow private pension funds to begin operations this year for the first time.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9549))</p>
</text>
